ls> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:41e1832e-bfc6-4814-a8c4-6056b61a1e17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:41e1832e-bfc6-4814-a8c4-6056b61a1e17\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On <a href=\"/wiki/The_Warden\" title=\"The Warden\">The Warden's</a> desk in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers_Prison\" title=\"Moonrise Towers Prison\">Moonrise Towers Prison</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;572&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-655</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A list of prisoners who have passed through the dungeons of Moonrise Towers. The page opens on the following entry.]\n</p><p><br>\nFionn Featherlight: Transferred to Disciple <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/25px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/38px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/50px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Balthazar's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/25px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar's</a> care.\n</p><p><br>\nYusuf Furaha: Found dead in cell. Remains sent to kitchen. \n</p><p><br>\nAnouska Tarasova: Swore allegiance to the Absolute - sent for subjugation.\n</p><p><br>\nNote: Disciple Balthazar's experiments now take priority. All\nprisoners are to be sent to his lab on his return, including:\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nimble\" title=\"Nimble\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Portrait_Nimble.png/25px-Portrait_Nimble.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Portrait_Nimble.png/38px-Portrait_Nimble.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Portrait_Nimble.png/50px-Portrait_Nimble.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nimble Panternon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Portrait_Nimble.png/25px-Portrait_Nimble.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f1/Portrait_Nimble.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nimble\" title=\"Nimble\">Nimble Panternon</a>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nickels\" title=\"Nickels\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Nickels.png/25px-Portrait_Nickels.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Nickels.png/38px-Portrait_Nickels.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Nickels.png/50px-Portrait_Nickels.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nickels Zeltron\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Nickels.png/25px-Portrait_Nickels.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Portrait_Nickels.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nickels\" title=\"Nickels\">Nickels Zeltron</a>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wulbren_Bongle\" title=\"Wulbren Bongle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png/25px-Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png/38px-Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png/50px-Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wulbren Bongle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png/25px-Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wulbren_Bongle\" title=\"Wulbren Bongle\">Wulbren Bongle</a>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714212306\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2647/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 42654/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13732/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 6/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1043194/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.843      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   50.843      1 -total\n 57.38%   29.173     11 Template:Icon_text\n 49.73%   25.283     25 Template:Trim\n 22.18%   11.278      6 Template:Icon_link\n 20.87%   10.612      5 Template:CharLink\n 18.89%    9.604      2 Template:Uid\n 12.63%    6.419      1 Tem